<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτρ-ῖνος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deep hole</i> from which water
			springs, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; of a hot spring or geyser in Cos, <i><span class="en">
				Antig.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				160
			</span></i>; <i>deep hole,</i> in a river, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				44
			</span></i>, in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυθρῖνος.</span></b> 
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>niche for a nest</i> in a dove-cot, in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυθρ-</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				14.6.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
